# Deployment scope. The built site is plain HTML plus dist/, styles/ and
# assets/ — the sources that PRODUCE it have no business being served.
#
# Found in QC (20 Aug 2026): the whole tree was public. scripts/page-other.jsx
# (228 KB), scripts/routes.js, scripts/prerender.py, scripts/build.mjs and
# WEBSITE-GUIDE.md all returned 200. scripts/tweaks-panel.jsx was still served
# verbatim at its own URL — including the window.parent.postMessage host
# protocol — even though commit 9cba675 removed it from the bundle. Verifying
# "absent from the bundle" tested the wrong artefact.
scripts/
*.md
!index.html
.claude/
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json

# LinkedIn post visuals are attachments for social, not site assets — nothing
# on the site links to them, so they do not need deploying.
assets/linkedin/
